WEBVTT

01:35.759 --> 01:40.850
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.610 --> 01:43.940
[Episode 33]

01:44.479 --> 01:45.229
Aren't you always

01:45.229 --> 01:46.490
by His Majesty's side?

01:46.940 --> 01:47.759
How could

01:47.759 --> 01:49.370
Bai Shouzhuo be killed out of the blue?

01:49.370 --> 01:51.280
And he was working for Prince of Zhennan?

01:51.280 --> 01:52.080
Your Majesty,

01:52.350 --> 01:54.229
Eunuch Bai proclaimed his innocence
until death.

01:54.229 --> 01:56.479
It was all the Princess of Susha's
accusation.

01:56.479 --> 01:57.740
The Princess of Susha?

01:58.150 --> 01:59.430
She was involved?

02:00.030 --> 02:01.230
It was the Princess of Susha

02:01.230 --> 02:03.560
who took His Majesty to arrest Eunuch Bai.

02:03.570 --> 02:05.230
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

02:05.230 --> 02:05.920
The Princess of Susha

02:05.920 --> 02:07.510
never leaves His Majesty's side.

02:07.510 --> 02:08.430
I dared not tell you.

02:08.430 --> 02:09.090
I am guilty.

02:09.180 --> 02:10.979
Your Majesty, please punish me.

02:11.000 --> 02:12.260
You are indeed guilty.

02:12.750 --> 02:14.240
But I want to give you

02:14.240 --> 02:15.840
a chance to atone.

02:16.520 --> 02:18.240
Go kill that bitch.

02:19.430 --> 02:20.829
Whatever method you use,

02:21.240 --> 02:22.500
I just want her dead.

02:23.960 --> 02:25.870
I've been in Shengjing for so many days,

02:25.870 --> 02:26.910
and the Emperor has kept me locked

02:26.910 --> 02:27.960
in Yeting Palace

02:28.240 --> 02:30.240
and only today allowed me to see you.

02:31.400 --> 02:32.260
Your Highness,

02:32.829 --> 02:34.340
what happened in Yujing

02:34.680 --> 02:36.810
has spread throughout Yeting Palace.

02:37.190 --> 02:38.910
What are we going to do now?

02:40.760 --> 02:41.850
You still have me.

02:43.410 --> 02:44.470
Trust me.

02:44.560 --> 02:46.150
One day I will take you home.

02:46.579 --> 02:48.440
But we are in enemy territory.

02:49.290 --> 02:51.350
And you're all alone, Your Highness.

02:51.420 --> 02:53.140
Perhaps I'm not alone.

02:54.120 --> 02:56.000
I've inquired about the situation
in Yujing.

02:56.000 --> 02:56.750
It seems no one

02:56.750 --> 02:58.280
has seen my brother's body.

02:58.710 --> 03:00.640
I've been thinking these past days

03:01.750 --> 03:03.280
that he must still be alive.

03:07.400 --> 03:08.590
Did you also feel Elder Zhou

03:08.590 --> 03:10.050
was acting strange today?

03:11.290 --> 03:12.390
His words today

03:12.770 --> 03:14.430
seemed like he was testing us.

03:15.030 --> 03:16.760
If you are determined to leave,

03:17.110 --> 03:19.790
will you fight your way out?

03:21.680 --> 03:22.280
Indeed.

03:22.750 --> 03:24.950
There was murderous intent in his eyes.

03:24.990 --> 03:25.750
I could feel it.

03:25.750 --> 03:26.750
He seemed to really want

03:26.750 --> 03:28.120
me to fight my way out.

03:32.240 --> 03:32.800
Ning Fei,

03:33.240 --> 03:34.360
you've been here the longest

03:34.360 --> 03:35.760
and know this place best.

03:36.030 --> 03:37.000
Tell us.

03:37.430 --> 03:38.120
What kind of person

03:38.120 --> 03:39.079
is Elder Zhou?

03:40.470 --> 03:41.240
Usually,

03:41.310 --> 03:43.040
he doesn't seem strange at all.

03:43.590 --> 03:44.840
He always talks about being content

03:44.840 --> 03:45.900
with a simple life.

03:47.710 --> 03:48.190
Wait.

03:48.800 --> 03:49.660
I remember now.

03:50.310 --> 03:51.079
After I recovered,

03:51.079 --> 03:52.240
he came to see me.

03:52.430 --> 03:53.240
At that time, he asked me many questions

03:53.240 --> 03:54.500
about His Highness...

03:57.470 --> 03:58.750
About Xia Jingshi.

03:59.360 --> 03:59.840
He even inquired

03:59.840 --> 04:01.590
about my relationship with Xia Jingshi.

04:01.590 --> 04:02.030
After learning about

04:02.030 --> 04:03.630
my history with Xia Jingshi,

04:04.120 --> 04:07.520
he hinted that I should introduce him
to Xia Jingshi someday.

04:07.680 --> 04:09.540
He wants to ally with Xia Jingshi?

04:10.280 --> 04:11.630
But he's a member of the Storm Alliance.

04:11.630 --> 04:13.360
He can't possibly leave this place.

04:13.360 --> 04:15.890
Unless he's been planning
to leave all along.

04:17.540 --> 04:18.959
Elder Zhou saved my life.

04:19.269 --> 04:20.930
I didn't want to overthink it.

04:21.240 --> 04:23.000
But today I could feel

04:23.720 --> 04:24.270
he was subtly

04:24.270 --> 04:25.680
hinting to us

04:25.750 --> 04:27.610
that the key to leaving this place

04:27.630 --> 04:28.760
lies with Elder Lei.

04:29.120 --> 04:29.870
Could it be

04:30.510 --> 04:31.710
that he wants to use us

04:31.870 --> 04:32.930
against Elder Lei?

04:35.040 --> 04:36.240
He came

04:36.560 --> 04:37.510
right after you quarreled

04:37.510 --> 04:38.750
with Lei Lie.

04:39.000 --> 04:39.670
Maybe

04:39.870 --> 04:40.930
he wants to exploit

04:41.000 --> 04:42.659
the conflict between you two.

04:43.310 --> 04:43.909
Oh, right.

04:44.480 --> 04:45.560
I just remembered

04:46.390 --> 04:47.990
something else suspicious.

04:48.560 --> 04:50.290
I once accidentally saw some of

04:50.600 --> 04:53.720
Elder Zhou's close followers
practicing martial arts.

04:53.720 --> 04:54.960
They're scholars.

04:55.190 --> 04:57.520
They don't need to practice martial arts.

05:01.870 --> 05:02.800
Does anyone else

05:02.830 --> 05:04.870
in the Storm Alliance know about this?

05:04.870 --> 05:06.800
No one does, I think.

05:08.310 --> 05:10.040
He's been secretly building his own force,

05:10.040 --> 05:11.570
maybe to stage a rebellion.

05:11.600 --> 05:12.510
It seems he might be

05:12.510 --> 05:14.770
really planning to move against Lei Lie.

05:23.870 --> 05:26.430
Once you go any farther, you'll be
outside the Storm Alliance's territory.

05:26.430 --> 05:27.960
What are you two doing here?

05:28.120 --> 05:28.560
Bro,

05:29.040 --> 05:30.500
we were ordered by an elder

05:30.510 --> 05:32.310
to gather herbs on the mountain.

05:45.240 --> 05:45.800
The people from the Woodcutter Branch

05:45.800 --> 05:47.860
will soon notice something's wrong.

05:48.240 --> 05:49.500
According to the plan,

05:49.630 --> 05:50.630
set up the ambush.

05:50.750 --> 05:51.310
Yes!

05:55.390 --> 05:56.000
You two,

05:56.159 --> 05:57.360
guard that entrance.

05:57.360 --> 05:57.870
Yes.

06:04.120 --> 06:04.650
[Great Shelter Hall]

06:06.510 --> 06:07.170
Godfather.

06:09.120 --> 06:10.630
Zhou Hao is trying
to sneak out of the Storm Alliance

06:10.630 --> 06:13.030
with some people from the Studying Branch.

06:13.600 --> 06:14.270
How is that possible?

06:14.270 --> 06:15.360
It's absolutely true.

06:15.360 --> 06:15.720
My men

06:15.720 --> 06:16.800
spotted their trail;

06:16.800 --> 06:18.060
they left not long ago.

06:20.360 --> 06:21.750
Gather everyone

06:22.200 --> 06:23.060
and go after them!

06:22.420 --> 06:23.100
[Storm Alliance]

06:35.240 --> 06:35.770
Let's go!

06:37.480 --> 06:37.940
How is it?

06:37.940 --> 06:38.470
Nothing.

06:39.630 --> 06:40.159
Nothing.

06:41.480 --> 06:42.080
Follow me.

07:00.400 --> 07:01.460
Protect Elder Lei!

07:04.870 --> 07:05.560
Lei Lie!

07:11.920 --> 07:12.510
Zhou Hao.

07:14.190 --> 07:15.280
What are you doing?

07:15.950 --> 07:16.560
Lei Lie,

07:17.070 --> 07:18.340
if you don't die,

07:18.510 --> 07:20.270
I'll be trapped here forever.

07:21.310 --> 07:22.240
Even if I'm fortunate enough

07:22.240 --> 07:23.370
to escape from here,

07:23.560 --> 07:24.560
with your temper,

07:25.000 --> 07:26.510
you'd still hunt me down

07:27.160 --> 07:28.680
to the ends of the world.

07:29.190 --> 07:29.790
Am I right?

07:37.800 --> 07:38.600
Are you saying

07:40.680 --> 07:41.800
you want to kill me?

07:53.360 --> 07:55.159
Brothers of the Storm Alliance,

07:55.240 --> 07:56.130
calm down.

07:56.750 --> 07:58.810
Let's sit down and talk this through.

07:59.920 --> 08:01.270
I saved your lives.

08:01.830 --> 08:03.240
Today I'm going to kill Lei Lie,

08:03.240 --> 08:04.900
and you're standing in my way?

08:09.360 --> 08:10.000
Lei Lie,

08:10.630 --> 08:12.160
after all that's happened,

08:12.390 --> 08:13.790
you've left me no choice!

08:14.360 --> 08:15.160
Raise the net!

08:56.690 --> 09:01.070
[Great Shelter Hall]

08:58.030 --> 08:58.550
Go!

08:58.910 --> 08:59.390
Hurry!

09:00.720 --> 09:01.150
Go.

09:07.360 --> 09:08.960
This is their family matter;

09:09.150 --> 09:10.880
let them handle it themselves.

09:13.010 --> 09:15.920
[Storm Alliance]

09:24.150 --> 09:25.550
I still don't understand

09:26.480 --> 09:27.870
why you want to kill me.

09:30.870 --> 09:32.870
I understand if others don't get it.

09:33.600 --> 09:34.750
But you?

09:36.840 --> 09:37.480
Why?

09:38.550 --> 09:39.600
Didn't your two sons

09:39.600 --> 09:40.270
also die

09:40.270 --> 09:41.470
right in front of you?

09:41.810 --> 09:42.910
Have you forgotten

09:42.910 --> 09:44.910
those desperate looks in their eyes

09:46.480 --> 09:47.670
before they died?

09:48.320 --> 09:49.870
I haven't forgotten for a single day.

09:49.870 --> 09:51.600
You say you haven't forgotten,

09:51.630 --> 09:53.560
but in your heart you already have.

09:53.600 --> 09:55.200
But I dare not forget.

09:56.840 --> 09:58.480
My dead husband

10:00.200 --> 10:02.150
and my unborn child—

10:03.410 --> 10:05.910
this blood debt—even if it turned to ash,

10:05.910 --> 10:06.990
I dare not forget.

10:07.240 --> 10:08.720
So I will kill Feng Suige!

10:08.720 --> 10:09.550
Do you understand now?

10:09.550 --> 10:10.670
I will kill him!

10:10.720 --> 10:12.630
But he is Qingyu's son.

10:13.360 --> 10:15.390
How many people in the Storm Alliance

10:15.390 --> 10:16.670
are alive today

10:16.670 --> 10:18.320
because of Qingyu's kindness?

10:18.320 --> 10:19.600
What about my child?

10:22.120 --> 10:23.320
What about your sons?

10:23.840 --> 10:25.320
Did they die for nothing?

10:26.910 --> 10:28.360
You want to repay kindness

10:28.360 --> 10:30.220
and seek revenge at the same time?

10:30.440 --> 10:31.390
Dream on!

10:32.080 --> 10:33.340
You've also heard that

10:35.030 --> 10:35.910
our enemy

10:35.910 --> 10:37.510
might not be Feng Pingcheng.

10:37.790 --> 10:39.320
What if we're really wrong?

10:39.670 --> 10:41.240
I can't afford to be wrong.

10:41.510 --> 10:43.240
The whole Storm Alliance is watching me.

10:41.540 --> 10:44.820
[Storm Alliance]

10:43.440 --> 10:44.870
If I point to the wrong enemy,

10:44.870 --> 10:47.470
everyone will follow me
into the same mistake.

10:47.480 --> 10:49.390
Why bother discussing this anymore?

10:49.390 --> 10:50.270
At this point,

10:50.480 --> 10:51.610
I accept our defeat.

10:51.960 --> 10:53.360
If you want to kill me, then do it.

10:53.360 --> 10:54.870
No need for this pretense.

10:55.510 --> 10:56.900
She is full of hatred

10:56.960 --> 10:58.550
that cannot be eased right now.

10:58.550 --> 10:59.550
I don't blame her.

11:00.120 --> 11:01.720
You're well-educated.

11:02.360 --> 11:03.790
Why did you do this?

11:03.910 --> 11:05.640
So you know I'm well-educated?

11:06.510 --> 11:09.320
Scholars should pass the imperial exam,
serve in office,

11:09.320 --> 11:11.160
govern the country
and bring peace to the world.

11:11.160 --> 11:14.210
[Storm Alliance]

11:11.480 --> 11:13.010
By trapping me in this cage,

11:13.080 --> 11:14.320
you ruined my future.

11:15.510 --> 11:16.790
Was it I who ruined you?

11:18.240 --> 11:20.440
When you were young,
you obsessed over the imperial exam,

11:20.440 --> 11:22.440
trying for years and never passing.

11:22.790 --> 11:24.120
Because of that, you fell into poverty

11:24.120 --> 11:25.510
and were nearly beaten to death
by creditors.

11:25.510 --> 11:26.670
If Qingyu hadn't met you

11:26.670 --> 11:27.320
and saved you,

11:27.320 --> 11:28.720
would you be alive today?

11:29.390 --> 11:31.550
The Storm Alliance is everyone's home,

11:31.550 --> 11:32.630
never a prison!

11:32.630 --> 11:33.720
If it's truly a home,

11:33.720 --> 11:34.840
there shouldn't be
so many unreasonable rules!

11:34.840 --> 11:36.480
Every rule was established

11:36.840 --> 11:38.160
for a reason.

11:38.480 --> 11:39.720
Without these rules,

11:39.790 --> 11:41.030
this family would have fallen apart
long ago.

11:41.030 --> 11:44.230
If it's meant to fall apart,
why force it to stay together?

11:44.390 --> 11:45.870
I'll kill you!

11:49.270 --> 11:51.720
You saved Feng Suige.

11:52.200 --> 11:53.120
Why can't you

11:53.120 --> 11:54.180
let go of the rules?

11:54.600 --> 11:55.870
You keep saying

11:55.870 --> 11:57.720
it's for the good of the Storm Alliance,

11:57.720 --> 11:58.200
but in truth,

11:58.200 --> 11:59.750
you just can't give up

11:59.750 --> 12:00.750
that bit of power!

12:01.030 --> 12:01.960
You want everyone

12:01.960 --> 12:04.080
under your control!

12:16.550 --> 12:18.810
We've known each other for so many years.

12:19.510 --> 12:22.040
We've overcome
so many challenges together.

12:22.600 --> 12:24.270
Is this how you see me?

12:28.660 --> 12:31.730
[Storm Alliance]

12:30.630 --> 12:31.510
Is that how

12:33.390 --> 12:35.000
all of you see me?

12:47.670 --> 12:48.330
Godfather!

12:48.380 --> 12:49.760
[Storm Alliance]

12:49.480 --> 12:50.790
What's wrong, Godfather?

12:50.790 --> 12:51.450
Godfather!

12:56.720 --> 12:57.380
Godfather!

12:57.630 --> 12:58.560
Are you alright?

12:59.960 --> 13:02.610
[Great Shelter Hall]

13:01.200 --> 13:01.780
Move!

13:02.150 --> 13:02.820
Godfather!

13:03.550 --> 13:04.080
Move!

13:04.320 --> 13:04.980
Godfather!

13:05.240 --> 13:05.870
Elder Lei!

13:06.670 --> 13:07.330
Godfather.

13:08.720 --> 13:09.360
Elder Lei.

13:09.670 --> 13:10.320
Elder Lei.

13:10.670 --> 13:12.000
Elder Lei, are you okay?

13:12.030 --> 13:12.750
Elder Lei.

13:13.390 --> 13:14.050
Godfather.

13:14.750 --> 13:15.520
Elder Zhou,

13:15.720 --> 13:16.630
you're a healer.

13:16.630 --> 13:17.960
You're the only one here
with medical knowledge.

13:17.960 --> 13:18.890
Please save him!

13:19.720 --> 13:20.380
Godfather.

13:21.910 --> 13:22.600
Elder Lei.

13:29.030 --> 13:31.560
I believe you won't stand by
and watch him die.

13:36.870 --> 13:37.530
Godfather.

13:52.270 --> 13:53.870
Zhou Hao, what are you doing?

13:57.240 --> 13:57.970
Don't worry.

13:58.670 --> 13:59.870
Elder Lei is fine now.

14:02.790 --> 14:04.070
His anger

14:04.550 --> 14:06.010
caused his qi to stagnate.

14:06.130 --> 14:07.870
If he hadn't been able to release
that blocked energy,

14:07.870 --> 14:09.360
he would have died for sure.

14:09.360 --> 14:11.580
Didn't you want to kill me?

14:12.960 --> 14:14.750
Why did you save me?

14:15.200 --> 14:16.860
My defeat is already certain.

14:17.630 --> 14:18.960
Whether I kill you or not

14:19.390 --> 14:20.790
doesn't matter anymore.

14:25.790 --> 14:26.450
Godfather.

14:29.160 --> 14:32.630
[Storm Alliance]

14:30.100 --> 14:31.300
I heard your argument

14:31.390 --> 14:32.650
from outside just now.

14:33.200 --> 14:34.310
Don't let impulse

14:34.600 --> 14:36.660
make you do something you'll regret.

14:37.000 --> 14:38.620
Whether you believe it or not,

14:38.620 --> 14:40.600
Feng Suige and I have both experienced

14:40.600 --> 14:42.780
the pain
of brothers turning against each other—

14:42.780 --> 14:44.640
and we understand it all too well.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.120
To be honest,

14:48.390 --> 14:49.120
I was a child

14:49.120 --> 14:50.180
without a home.

14:50.960 --> 14:51.760
You don't know

14:52.080 --> 14:53.320
how much I envy you.

14:54.510 --> 14:55.750
Because of that,

14:56.720 --> 14:57.480
and because

14:57.480 --> 14:59.480
I've experienced such pain myself,

14:59.670 --> 15:00.600
I can't bear to see

15:00.600 --> 15:01.960
you fall apart

15:02.320 --> 15:03.450
and lose your unity.

15:03.970 --> 15:08.240
[Storm Alliance]

15:04.220 --> 15:05.000
A family

15:05.200 --> 15:06.460
will inevitably argue

15:06.790 --> 15:07.840
and clash,

15:08.360 --> 15:10.230
but a home is always a home,

15:10.720 --> 15:12.960
a place that shelters you from the storm.

15:12.960 --> 15:13.480
Family

15:14.510 --> 15:15.770
will always be family;

15:16.360 --> 15:18.090
they are each other's support.

15:26.120 --> 15:26.790
Elder Zhou,

15:28.080 --> 15:30.280
you only wanted to kill Elder Lei before

15:30.320 --> 15:31.750
because you hadn't thought it through,

15:31.750 --> 15:32.360
right?

15:34.400 --> 15:37.310
[Storm Alliance]

15:34.510 --> 15:35.240
Elder Zhang,

15:35.840 --> 15:36.550
when Elder Lei

15:36.550 --> 15:37.550
fell ill earlier,

15:37.630 --> 15:38.720
you couldn't bear to see it either,

15:38.720 --> 15:39.320
could you?

15:40.440 --> 15:42.020
Ask yourselves honestly:

15:42.440 --> 15:43.910
just now, weren't you worried

15:43.910 --> 15:45.240
something would happen to Elder Lei?

15:45.240 --> 15:46.000
Isn't he

15:46.000 --> 15:48.000
your most important family member?

15:57.340 --> 16:00.130
[Storm Alliance]

16:11.410 --> 16:12.470
What do you mean?

16:12.670 --> 16:14.730
Don't you want to kill me for revenge?

16:14.910 --> 16:16.240
I'm giving you a chance.

16:27.610 --> 16:28.420
Feng Suige,

16:29.510 --> 16:30.970
you know I want to kill you.

16:32.360 --> 16:33.760
Why did you still save me?

16:36.440 --> 16:37.240
The last words I said to my father

16:37.240 --> 16:38.480
were that

16:39.510 --> 16:41.150
our father‑son bond

16:41.150 --> 16:42.080
and the duties between ruler and subject

16:42.080 --> 16:43.540
were completely severed.

16:43.960 --> 16:44.960
That was because I discovered

16:44.960 --> 16:47.360
that my mother's death
was connected to him

16:47.870 --> 16:49.360
and that my life

16:49.360 --> 16:50.960
had been manipulated by him.

16:51.170 --> 16:52.100
I didn't kill him

16:52.870 --> 16:54.600
only because he was my father.

16:55.390 --> 16:56.790
It's not a choice I can make;

16:56.790 --> 16:57.920
I can only accept it.

16:58.360 --> 16:59.080
You hate me.

16:59.790 --> 17:00.850
You want to kill me.

17:01.510 --> 17:03.640
This too is not something I can choose.

17:03.670 --> 17:05.270
But I will uncover the truth.

17:05.589 --> 17:06.349
If all of this

17:06.349 --> 17:07.829
was truly my father's wrongdoing,

17:07.829 --> 17:08.630
I will bear it.

17:09.550 --> 17:10.680
If you want revenge,

17:11.400 --> 17:12.510
I will accept it.

17:15.530 --> 17:19.089
[Storm Alliance]

17:16.920 --> 17:17.880
Many of you here

17:17.880 --> 17:18.720
hate me deeply

17:19.640 --> 17:21.569
because I'm Feng Pingcheng's son.

17:22.270 --> 17:23.510
So what I said just now

17:24.000 --> 17:25.660
was also meant for you to hear.

17:26.109 --> 17:27.770
Whether you believe me or not,

17:27.960 --> 17:29.440
I will uncover the truth.

17:37.110 --> 17:37.840
Elder Zhang,

17:38.350 --> 17:39.880
only when you know the truth

17:40.400 --> 17:42.200
can you truly have your revenge.

17:42.920 --> 17:43.960
Since you're willing

17:43.960 --> 17:45.490
to do anything for revenge,

17:45.790 --> 17:47.850
why can't you be a little more patient

17:47.960 --> 17:49.220
and wait for an answer?

17:54.550 --> 17:56.350
Will you really give me this answer?

17:56.350 --> 17:58.280
I, Feng Suige, always keep my word.

18:04.070 --> 18:04.590
Fine.

18:06.220 --> 18:07.680
I'll wait for your answer.

18:13.680 --> 18:14.350
Elder Lei,

18:15.350 --> 18:17.410
are you willing to wait for the truth?

18:18.000 --> 18:19.530
It doesn't matter anymore.

18:20.880 --> 18:22.340
Whether I'm willing or not

18:23.400 --> 18:24.880
is no longer important.

18:27.570 --> 18:32.310
[Storm Alliance]

18:30.030 --> 18:31.830
I want to ask all of you a question

18:33.200 --> 18:34.790
I've never asked before:

18:36.510 --> 18:39.310
do you want to strictly follow
the alliance rules?

18:50.550 --> 18:51.750
You want to leave too?

18:52.340 --> 18:55.210
[Storm Alliance]

18:52.720 --> 18:54.880
I beg you to tell me the truth.

19:04.960 --> 19:05.620
Godfather,

19:08.960 --> 19:10.360
I don't want to lie to you.

19:12.920 --> 19:13.830
I see.

19:16.000 --> 19:17.200
So it turns out

19:20.550 --> 19:23.280
I've been the only one
wishing for this all along.

19:28.200 --> 19:28.860
Godfather!

20:26.270 --> 20:27.070
Actually, Elder Lei

20:27.070 --> 20:28.180
has his reasons.

20:28.720 --> 20:30.180
Many in the Storm Alliance

20:30.240 --> 20:31.110
have never seen

20:31.110 --> 20:32.680
the dangers of the outside world.

20:32.680 --> 20:34.010
They only long to go out,

20:34.550 --> 20:36.010
but they don't appreciate

20:36.270 --> 20:38.000
how precious this paradise is.

20:38.350 --> 20:39.310
A person won't know

20:39.310 --> 20:41.170
the taste of pain until they fall.

20:41.350 --> 20:43.150
You've been through so much pain

20:43.240 --> 20:45.370
that you've come to this realization.

20:48.240 --> 20:49.570
And haven't you as well?

20:49.960 --> 20:51.560
The pain you've experienced

20:51.830 --> 20:53.030
is greater and deeper

20:53.270 --> 20:54.000
than mine.

20:58.200 --> 20:59.270
Today, you said

20:59.720 --> 21:01.520
you're an orphan without a home.

21:01.880 --> 21:03.210
But now it's different.

21:03.550 --> 21:04.640
Now you have me.

21:05.350 --> 21:07.070
I will always be your family.

21:11.480 --> 21:13.540
We've been through so much together.

21:13.750 --> 21:15.080
Because I lost my memory

21:15.510 --> 21:17.240
we went from enemies to lovers,

21:17.880 --> 21:19.140
and when you lost yours

21:19.240 --> 21:21.640
we nearly went from lovers
back to enemies.

21:23.110 --> 21:24.110
But even so,

21:24.830 --> 21:25.550
you're still willing

21:25.550 --> 21:26.590
to be my family.

21:28.270 --> 21:28.960
Thank you.

21:35.720 --> 21:37.380
After all we've been through,

21:37.480 --> 21:38.740
don't you feel bitter?

21:39.440 --> 21:40.350
With you here,

21:40.750 --> 21:41.920
how could I?

21:45.200 --> 21:46.330
I'll always be here.

21:48.400 --> 21:49.830
I'm sure after this,

21:50.720 --> 21:51.640
Elder Lei won't be

21:51.640 --> 21:53.440
so rigid in following the rules;

21:53.480 --> 21:54.270
we should be able

21:54.270 --> 21:55.200
to leave soon.

21:55.720 --> 21:57.380
Wherever you go in the future,

21:57.830 --> 21:58.880
I will be with you.

22:05.310 --> 22:06.640
When we return to Susha,

22:07.310 --> 22:08.720
we'll reveal the truth.

22:09.510 --> 22:10.970
It's not just for revenge,

22:11.510 --> 22:12.960
but also to show the world

22:13.350 --> 22:15.000
that Xiyang's brother isn't a villain

22:15.000 --> 22:16.730
who killed his father and king.

22:17.790 --> 22:19.330
I'll send word to Xiyang

22:19.720 --> 22:21.030
to tell her I'm alive.

22:21.750 --> 22:23.830
I can't bring her back

22:24.510 --> 22:25.270
with peace of mind

22:25.270 --> 22:27.670
until I've personally killed our enemies.

22:30.790 --> 22:31.400
Murong Zhong and his son

22:31.400 --> 22:32.790
haven't found your whereabouts.

22:32.790 --> 22:34.450
They certainly won't give up.

22:34.830 --> 22:36.200
When we return to Yujing this time,

22:36.200 --> 22:37.530
it'll be full of danger.

22:37.790 --> 22:38.920
After leaving here,

22:39.030 --> 22:39.790
let's first find someone

22:39.790 --> 22:41.480
to get a clear picture
of the current situation.

22:41.480 --> 22:43.740
This person is completely trustworthy.

22:44.110 --> 22:44.590
Okay.

22:56.830 --> 22:59.430
Killing Murong Zhong
and his son won't be easy.

22:59.830 --> 23:00.750
Why did you agree to that

23:00.750 --> 23:01.730
so readily?

23:02.030 --> 23:02.920
When my army

23:02.920 --> 23:04.240
breaks through your Susha,

23:04.240 --> 23:05.550
taking their heads

23:05.550 --> 23:06.550
won't be hard.

23:07.400 --> 23:09.590
You're still going to send troops
to attack Susha?

23:09.590 --> 23:11.270
Our two countries
have finally achieved peace.

23:11.270 --> 23:11.960
What good would attacking Susha again

23:11.960 --> 23:13.290
do for you?

23:14.720 --> 23:15.310
What?

23:15.790 --> 23:16.830
Now you suddenly care about

23:16.830 --> 23:18.120
the people of Susha?

23:18.440 --> 23:20.270
I only agreed to help you kill them;

23:20.270 --> 23:21.930
I never agreed to how I'd do it.

23:22.590 --> 23:24.850
I only want Murong Zhong and his son dead.

23:24.920 --> 23:27.120
I don't want innocent people to suffer.

23:28.640 --> 23:29.440
You're angry?

23:30.110 --> 23:31.170
It doesn't matter.

23:31.590 --> 23:32.720
As long as I'm happy.

23:35.880 --> 23:36.640
Whether to send troops

23:36.640 --> 23:38.110
isn't for you to decide, is it?

23:38.110 --> 23:39.110
Isn't your mother

23:39.110 --> 23:40.510
the real ruler of Jinxiu?

23:46.120 --> 23:47.450
Dare you say that again?

23:47.830 --> 23:49.210
Am I wrong?

23:49.680 --> 23:51.200
Dare to make another bet with me?

23:51.200 --> 23:52.060
I'm listening.

23:52.310 --> 23:53.300
I bet your mother

23:53.350 --> 23:55.550
doesn't care about your opinion at all.

23:55.610 --> 23:57.410
She sees me as a thorn in her side.

23:57.830 --> 23:59.690
She will find a way to get rid of me.

24:01.590 --> 24:02.200
Fine.

24:02.400 --> 24:03.460
I'll take that bet.

24:16.640 --> 24:17.310
In 15 minutes,

24:17.310 --> 24:18.310
the Royal Guards will be back here.

24:18.310 --> 24:19.240
We must be quick.

24:22.790 --> 24:23.650
Your Highness,

24:23.880 --> 24:25.270
the water's getting cold.

24:25.270 --> 24:27.270
You've been bathing for a long time.

24:27.350 --> 24:28.610
Shall I help you dress?

24:30.200 --> 24:32.330
No matter how long I bathe, it's no use.

24:33.110 --> 24:33.730
[Yujian Pavilion]

24:35.990 --> 24:37.230
I won't get clean.

24:48.700 --> 24:50.840
[Yujian Pavilion]

25:26.720 --> 25:27.310
Kneel!

25:58.640 --> 25:59.340
Get out.

26:00.000 --> 26:00.800
You may leave.

26:01.680 --> 26:02.200
Yes.

26:06.850 --> 26:08.680
I killed the person who wanted to kill you

26:08.680 --> 26:09.830
with my own hands.

26:10.310 --> 26:11.110
So?

26:11.400 --> 26:12.240
From now on,

26:12.750 --> 26:14.950
no one in this palace will dare kill you.

26:17.680 --> 26:18.790
I won again,

26:19.550 --> 26:20.160
didn't I?

26:35.400 --> 26:40.750
[Storm Alliance]

26:44.210 --> 26:49.400
[Storm Alliance]

26:55.680 --> 26:56.310
Elder Lei,

26:57.200 --> 26:59.130
what are your plans for the future?

26:59.510 --> 27:00.110
I...

27:01.880 --> 27:03.210
I'm not going anywhere.

27:03.830 --> 27:04.880
I'll stay here.

27:06.350 --> 27:07.610
In case they come back,

27:07.830 --> 27:09.230
someone needs to be home.

27:13.660 --> 27:15.070
If I'm not mistaken,

27:15.680 --> 27:17.480
you're also here to say goodbye.

27:18.350 --> 27:18.920
Yes.

27:31.030 --> 27:32.000
I saved you,

27:32.550 --> 27:33.510
and you saved me.

27:34.590 --> 27:35.750
You and I

27:36.680 --> 27:37.550
are even now.

27:38.550 --> 27:39.880
Since I gave you my word,

27:40.200 --> 27:41.440
I'll do everything I can

27:41.440 --> 27:42.640
to find out the truth.

27:43.110 --> 27:44.240
May I

27:45.880 --> 27:47.080
ask you for one favor?

27:47.550 --> 27:48.350
Please speak.

27:48.940 --> 27:50.510
You're both capable people

27:51.590 --> 27:53.310
who've seen all kinds of storms.

27:53.310 --> 27:55.110
If any member of the Storm Alliance

27:55.110 --> 27:57.000
runs into trouble out there

27:57.510 --> 27:58.910
and comes to you for help,

27:59.550 --> 28:00.240
could you—

28:00.240 --> 28:02.350
for my sake—

28:03.400 --> 28:05.070
not let them go hungry or cold?

28:05.440 --> 28:06.370
You can send them

28:07.590 --> 28:09.110
back to me.

28:09.720 --> 28:10.310
Alright.

28:11.160 --> 28:12.000
I promise you.

28:12.400 --> 28:13.600
Of course, Elder Lei.

28:13.840 --> 28:15.040
Please rest assured.

28:42.350 --> 28:45.080
Lei Lie has agreed
to let them leave the mountain.

28:45.590 --> 28:47.190
I have more good news for you.

28:47.480 --> 28:48.310
From now on,

28:48.310 --> 28:49.310
anyone who wants to leave
the Storm Alliance

28:49.310 --> 28:50.440
can do so at any time.

28:53.740 --> 28:56.300
I'm here to say goodbye.

29:00.240 --> 29:01.110
Before I leave,

29:01.920 --> 29:03.250
there's one more thing.

29:04.880 --> 29:07.430
I lost our bet, didn't I?

29:08.580 --> 29:09.880
I'm giving you Zhengnian Villa.

29:09.880 --> 29:11.680
Who wants your stupid villa?

29:12.510 --> 29:13.550
You said it yourself.

29:13.550 --> 29:14.550
No take-backs.

29:20.680 --> 29:21.390
Well...

29:22.000 --> 29:22.750
a bet is a bet.

29:23.880 --> 29:25.280
I can't owe you anything.

29:25.510 --> 29:26.830
As long as it's within my power,

29:26.830 --> 29:28.290
just tell me what you want.

29:33.030 --> 29:35.000
I want you to drink this.

29:36.160 --> 29:36.830
Mushroom?

29:37.640 --> 29:38.350
Drink it.

29:38.400 --> 29:40.550
I've already had some.
What are you afraid of?

29:40.550 --> 29:41.550
Once I drink this,

29:41.550 --> 29:42.590
we're even, alright?

29:42.590 --> 29:44.240
Yes, we'll be even.

30:04.830 --> 30:06.270
What is this?

30:07.550 --> 30:13.030
A new medicine I developed.

30:13.200 --> 30:15.400
It dispels dampness.

30:19.200 --> 30:20.030
I...

30:21.510 --> 30:24.270
How would I know?

30:24.310 --> 30:26.350
Why is this...

30:26.440 --> 30:31.160
dampness-dispelling medicine so strong?

30:32.430 --> 30:36.680
I want you to drink it.

30:36.740 --> 30:38.110
You don't know?

30:38.110 --> 30:40.270
And you made me drink it?

30:55.160 --> 30:57.120
I'm dying of laughter.

31:03.180 --> 31:04.960
Your injuries are mostly healed,

31:04.960 --> 31:06.680
but they still need time to fully recover.

31:06.680 --> 31:08.640
This medicine can nourish the body
and restore your energy.

31:08.640 --> 31:10.170
Take 2 pills a day for 5 days,

31:10.640 --> 31:13.170
and you should recover
about 70 to 80 percent.

31:13.310 --> 31:15.110
Thank you, Young Mistress Ling.

31:16.230 --> 31:17.480
What about you, Xueying?

31:17.480 --> 31:18.880
What are your plans next?

31:19.680 --> 31:20.750
I just went to find my father

31:20.750 --> 31:21.590
at Lady An's place.

31:21.590 --> 31:22.880
He left me a note

31:23.270 --> 31:24.030
saying...

31:24.030 --> 31:25.690
he went traveling with Lady An

31:25.790 --> 31:26.440
and told me to go back

31:26.440 --> 31:28.240
and look after Zhengnian Villa.

31:33.510 --> 31:34.110
Yixiao.

31:35.960 --> 31:36.610
Ning Fei.

31:37.590 --> 31:38.640
I prepared some dry rations

31:38.640 --> 31:40.300
for you to eat on your journey.

31:40.640 --> 31:41.240
Thank you.

31:41.240 --> 31:41.640
Yes.

31:42.070 --> 31:42.440
Here.

31:42.440 --> 31:43.040
Thank you.

31:44.200 --> 31:45.320
Ning Fei has agreed

31:45.440 --> 31:47.500
to return to Zhengnian Villa with me.

31:50.440 --> 31:51.210
That's good.

31:51.510 --> 31:52.720
You can look out for each other,

31:52.720 --> 31:54.180
which puts my mind at ease.

31:54.440 --> 31:55.830
You must take care of yourselves.

31:55.830 --> 31:57.070
After I send Xueying back,

31:57.070 --> 31:58.240
I'll come join you.

31:58.640 --> 32:00.310
Maybe I can be of some help.

32:00.640 --> 32:01.160
Okay.

32:01.720 --> 32:03.600
I'll thank you in advance.

32:04.000 --> 32:05.440
Why are you being so polite again?

32:05.440 --> 32:07.100
I told you we're brothers now.

32:18.960 --> 32:20.750
This list names so many officials

32:20.750 --> 32:21.960
to be promoted.

32:21.960 --> 32:24.310
[Li Boyong] [Zhang Ziyu]

32:23.510 --> 32:24.160
Yes.

32:24.640 --> 32:27.110
The new emperor
has just ascended the throne,

32:27.110 --> 32:29.030
and state affairs are in disarray.

32:29.030 --> 32:31.290
All the departments are short of people.

32:31.590 --> 32:33.450
We really need to add more people.

32:35.000 --> 32:36.590
Did you draft this list?

32:37.200 --> 32:38.820
I discussed it

32:38.920 --> 32:40.790
with the other ministers at court.

32:40.790 --> 32:42.320
They had no objections.

32:42.640 --> 32:44.890
Once His Majesty approves it,

32:45.440 --> 32:48.100
I can send the appointments
to each department.

32:48.110 --> 32:49.200
Your Highness,

32:49.200 --> 32:50.920
you are truly devoted to Susha.

32:50.920 --> 32:51.720
You've reached the age

32:51.720 --> 32:53.960
when you should be enjoying retirement
in your hometown.

32:53.960 --> 32:55.440
Yet you're still managing state affairs

32:55.440 --> 32:57.200
for this widow and her orphaned son.

32:57.200 --> 32:58.980
I am truly moved.

32:59.310 --> 33:01.960
I only wish to dedicate myself fully

33:03.270 --> 33:05.160
and help ease His Majesty's burdens.

33:05.160 --> 33:05.960
However,

33:06.830 --> 33:09.830
selecting officials
is a matter of great importance.

33:09.880 --> 33:11.000
Let's wait until I have discussed it
with His Majesty

33:11.000 --> 33:13.400
before making any decisions.

33:23.590 --> 33:24.350
Very well.

33:24.830 --> 33:26.420
I'll return to my residence

33:27.270 --> 33:28.880
and await your news.

33:33.160 --> 33:33.760
By the way,

33:34.640 --> 33:35.970
there's another matter

33:36.070 --> 33:37.440
of utmost importance

33:38.680 --> 33:41.030
that I must report to you and His Majesty

33:41.790 --> 33:42.650
for a decision.

33:43.750 --> 33:45.680
Feng Suige has disappeared,

33:46.680 --> 33:48.740
and we don't know if he's still alive.

33:49.480 --> 33:50.410
What did you say?

33:50.920 --> 33:52.400
Isn't he already dead?

33:52.920 --> 33:54.050
His body is missing.

33:54.550 --> 33:56.680
I'm afraid there might be
unexpected trouble.

33:56.680 --> 33:58.750
I was planning to wait until
the court stabilized

33:58.750 --> 33:59.830
before personally

34:00.270 --> 34:01.870
investigating this matter,

34:02.750 --> 34:03.920
but as I just said,

34:04.270 --> 34:06.270
with all departments short of staff,

34:06.270 --> 34:07.380
I can't leave.

34:12.760 --> 34:13.620
Your Highness,

34:14.230 --> 34:16.030
are you threatening me?

34:18.320 --> 34:19.500
How could I?

34:20.190 --> 34:21.719
Your Majesty, you once said

34:22.190 --> 34:23.710
that our fates

34:24.070 --> 34:25.670
are shared in glory and loss.

34:25.710 --> 34:26.590
I've never

34:27.070 --> 34:28.670
forgotten that.

34:29.920 --> 34:31.000
I'll take my leave.

34:42.630 --> 34:43.360
Servants.

34:45.929 --> 34:46.800
Bring me

34:46.800 --> 34:48.510
the list of consort candidates

34:48.510 --> 34:49.920
prepared for His Majesty.

34:49.920 --> 34:50.630
Yes.

34:52.350 --> 34:55.679
[Murong Residence]

35:02.510 --> 35:03.030
Father,

35:03.670 --> 35:04.590
will the Empress Dowager

35:04.590 --> 35:05.650
agree to that list?

35:07.670 --> 35:08.710
She will.

35:11.480 --> 35:12.230
Most of the people

35:12.230 --> 35:12.880
on that list

35:12.880 --> 35:13.740
are our people.

35:13.840 --> 35:15.700
She didn't raise any objections?

35:16.070 --> 35:18.530
She thinks
now that the situation is stable,

35:18.590 --> 35:20.370
she can abandon us.

35:20.510 --> 35:22.770
She wants to suppress our Murong family.

35:23.070 --> 35:24.440
Then I'll make her see

35:24.510 --> 35:25.880
that if I could put her Feng Chengyang

35:25.880 --> 35:27.620
on the throne,

35:27.710 --> 35:29.150
I can just as easily

35:29.230 --> 35:30.030
pull him down.

35:32.360 --> 35:32.960
Yao,

35:34.760 --> 35:36.440
I've told you many times.

35:37.320 --> 35:38.320
At this point,

35:39.110 --> 35:39.880
there's

35:39.880 --> 35:41.750
no turning back for us.

35:42.000 --> 35:43.510
Since we've come this far,

35:44.710 --> 35:46.230
we might as well

35:46.280 --> 35:47.280
go all the way.

35:48.440 --> 35:49.710
When the time is right,

35:50.710 --> 35:53.320
I'll make you emperor too.

35:55.190 --> 35:56.070
Are you ready?

35:57.840 --> 35:58.300
Father,

35:59.080 --> 36:00.340
for the Murong family,

36:01.670 --> 36:03.070
I'll do whatever you say.

36:13.190 --> 36:14.630
A handful of people?

36:15.880 --> 36:17.540
Aside from the Murong family,

36:18.460 --> 36:21.150
the only one
who can mobilize the Imperial Guards

36:21.150 --> 36:22.440
is my mother.

36:23.670 --> 36:24.190
Right?

36:24.550 --> 36:25.840
I didn't say that.

36:25.890 --> 36:27.160
I don't know anything.

36:27.230 --> 36:29.070
I don't know anything!

36:31.590 --> 36:33.450
The Empress Dowager has arrived!

36:44.030 --> 36:46.480
[Qi Lingsu]

36:45.320 --> 36:46.080
This

36:46.210 --> 36:47.230
is the eldest daughter of Qi Zheng,
Marquis of Huainan

36:47.230 --> 36:49.090
and Grand Commander of Yongzhou.

36:50.110 --> 36:51.920
There are other candidates
for consorts as well.

36:51.920 --> 36:53.000
They are all daughters
of military generals.

36:52.890 --> 36:54.130
[Qi Lingsu]

36:53.360 --> 36:54.020
Take a look.

36:55.630 --> 36:56.280
Leave us.

37:05.920 --> 37:06.510
Mother,

37:07.230 --> 37:08.440
I've told you before.

37:09.320 --> 37:10.850
I don't want to get married.

37:11.150 --> 37:12.670
Qi Zheng has military merits

37:12.670 --> 37:14.280
and is a trusted aide of your grandfather.

37:14.280 --> 37:15.630
He will be on our side.

37:15.760 --> 37:17.230
If your birth charts match,

37:17.230 --> 37:18.960
we'll grant him the title of prince.

37:18.960 --> 37:19.760
In the future,

37:19.800 --> 37:20.760
he'll not only be able to

37:20.760 --> 37:22.400
rival Murong Zhong and his son,

37:22.400 --> 37:23.320
but also help you

37:23.320 --> 37:24.960
secure your position on the throne.

37:24.960 --> 37:27.090
You talk about these things every day.

37:27.320 --> 37:28.520
Is there nothing else

37:29.030 --> 37:30.490
in your eyes?

37:30.590 --> 37:32.590
If you don't want to be manipulated,

37:33.480 --> 37:34.910
you must do as I say.

37:35.190 --> 37:36.030
Since I was a child,

37:36.030 --> 37:37.360
you've always taught me

37:37.590 --> 37:38.420
to compete,

37:38.880 --> 37:39.680
to gain favor,

37:40.070 --> 37:41.590
to please Father,

37:41.960 --> 37:43.220
to inherit the throne,

37:43.710 --> 37:44.670
but you've never

37:44.670 --> 37:45.880
asked me

37:46.710 --> 37:48.230
what I actually want.

37:49.070 --> 37:51.110
You're already the Emperor of Susha.

37:51.110 --> 37:52.310
What more do you want?

37:52.880 --> 37:53.960
With your position

37:54.400 --> 37:56.630
comes many obligations
beyond your control.

37:56.630 --> 37:58.100
Instead of wasting time

37:58.150 --> 37:59.070
on useless thoughts,

37:59.070 --> 38:00.430
you should focus on

38:00.590 --> 38:02.520
how to be a good emperor.

38:03.070 --> 38:04.400
Mother, do you truly want me

38:04.400 --> 38:05.530
to be a good emperor?

38:05.840 --> 38:06.550
Of course.

38:07.150 --> 38:08.440
Why won't you

38:09.480 --> 38:11.150
tell me the truth

38:13.280 --> 38:15.110
behind my father's death?

38:18.920 --> 38:20.070
You said

38:20.760 --> 38:21.400
that my father

38:21.400 --> 38:22.880
was killed by my brother.

38:23.630 --> 38:24.790
Is that really true?

38:25.510 --> 38:26.320
For you,

38:27.150 --> 38:28.550
I've sacrificed so much,

38:28.880 --> 38:30.360
yet you dare question me?

38:31.070 --> 38:31.840
Fine.

38:32.550 --> 38:33.630
From now on,

38:34.070 --> 38:35.930
I will decide everything for you.

38:36.000 --> 38:37.630
I won't consult with you anymore,

38:37.630 --> 38:39.630
and I don't care if you like it or not.

38:40.190 --> 38:42.050
I'll help you secure your throne.

38:42.880 --> 38:44.110
If you want to hate me,

38:45.070 --> 38:45.880
then hate me.

38:57.110 --> 38:58.360
This is the residence of Song Cheng,

38:58.360 --> 38:59.510
a scout of the Feng Battalion.

38:59.510 --> 39:01.030
He's absolutely trustworthy.

39:01.030 --> 39:01.550
Let's find him first

39:01.550 --> 39:04.150
to learn the current situation
in Yujing City.

39:04.230 --> 39:04.800
Be careful

39:04.800 --> 39:06.000
not to be spotted
by Murong Zhong and his son.

39:06.000 --> 39:06.710
Be careful.

39:10.400 --> 39:10.930
Let's go.

39:26.510 --> 39:27.240
Lu Ke.

39:38.880 --> 39:39.760
Miss Yixiao?

39:50.110 --> 39:50.970
Your Highness?

39:53.760 --> 39:54.510
Yun Qing?

39:57.320 --> 39:58.180
Your Highness.

40:00.190 --> 40:00.800
Yun Qing.

40:06.710 --> 40:07.400
Your Highness.

40:07.400 --> 40:08.930
-Your Highness!
-Yun Fang.

40:14.360 --> 40:14.920
Are you alright?

40:14.920 --> 40:15.450
I'm fine.

40:24.190 --> 40:25.920
Your Highness, please come in.

40:32.670 --> 40:34.330
Where are the other brothers?

41:29.130 --> 41:29.720
[Song Cheng's Offering]

41:34.440 --> 41:36.710
[In Memory of my friend Li Hu]
[In Memory of my friend Chen San]

41:36.710 --> 41:39.000
[In Memory of my friend Gu Yu]
[In Memory of my friend Hound]

41:48.370 --> 41:50.080
[In Memory of my friend Gu Yu]

41:54.810 --> 41:56.370
[In Memory of my friend Hound]

42:01.550 --> 42:04.120
[In Memory of my friend Gu Yu]
[In Memory of my friend Hound]

42:15.110 --> 42:15.640
Alright!

42:24.590 --> 42:26.190
They all say you committed treason

42:26.190 --> 42:26.840
and died.

42:27.440 --> 42:28.500
I don't believe it.

42:28.880 --> 42:30.220
I'm a scout.

42:30.800 --> 42:31.510
I only believe

42:31.510 --> 42:32.970
what I see with my own eyes.

42:33.320 --> 42:34.780
In my eyes, you're someone

42:34.920 --> 42:36.440
who values loyalty and righteousness

42:36.440 --> 42:38.240
and could never commit treason.

42:38.670 --> 42:40.510
You must have been framed.

42:41.030 --> 42:42.630
So I investigated in secret,

42:43.030 --> 42:43.630
found

42:43.630 --> 42:45.030
these brothers' bodies,

42:45.590 --> 42:47.030
and secretly buried them.
